# Device account: publish its own topics, never subscribe.
user flood-device
topic write floodmonitor/telemetry
topic write floodmonitor/debug
topic write floodmonitor/status
topic write iot/flood/#

# Ingest/dashboard account: read only.
user flood-reader
topic read floodmonitor/telemetry
topic read floodmonitor/debug
topic read floodmonitor/status
topic read iot/flood/#
